# Dependencies
node_modules

# Build output
dist
*.tsbuildinfo
*.zip

# Local agent configuration and scratch notes — tooling for whoever is working
# on this, not part of the extension.
.claude/
CLAUDE.md
yeniden.md

# Copy-paste buffer for the store dashboard. The descriptions themselves live
# in STORE-LISTING.md; this is that content flattened for pasting, and two
# copies of the same prose in the repo would drift.
store-descriptions.txt

# Console snippet that fills the extension's own IndexedDB with fabricated
# scans, so the store screenshots can be taken from the real dashboard without
# any real person's handle in them. A capture-session tool, not part of the
# extension — and nothing should be able to import it by accident.
seed-demo-data.js

# Store screenshots, cropped and scaled for upload. Submission artefacts, not
# repo content.
store-screenshots/

# Brand sources: the HTML the social card and both store tiles are rasterised
# from, the icon renderer, and the rendered store tiles. Deliberately outside
# the repository — the MIT licence covers the code, not the name or the mark,
# and a fork is expected to bring its own. The rendered social card is the one
# exception and stays in docs/, because the site has to serve it.
brand-sources/

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.local
